[00:00.000] 作词 : Thomas Bergersen
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Thomas Bergersen
[01:05.767]Through action, (身先士卒)
[01:07.879]a Man becomes a Hero (雄姿英发)
[01:09.194]Through death, (舍生取义)
[01:10.774]a Hero becomes a Legend (铸就传奇)
[01:12.327]Through time, a Legend becomes a Myth (历久弥新，终为神话)
[01:15.708]And by learning from the Myth, (上行下效)
[01:17.549]a Man takes action (前仆后继)
[01:19.119]Through action, (身体力行)
[01:21.212]a Man becomes a Hero (雄姿英发)
[01:22.259]Through death, (马革裹尸)
[01:24.057]a Hero becomes a Legend (铸就传奇)
[01:25.623]Through time, a Legend becomes a Myth (历久弥新，终为神话)
[01:28.981]And by learning from the Myth, (上行下效)
[01:31.078]a Man takes action (薪火相传)
